WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.860
Hey guys,
Just a very quick reminder.&nbsp;

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:07.260
If you watch what's going on in the news - listen&nbsp;
to people - just see actually what's going on.&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.420
It's pretty overwhelming.
There's darkness all over the place.&nbsp;

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.220
And if you listen to your emotions and other&nbsp;
people in the news - you will feel depressed.&nbsp;

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:22.680
And man, almost feel like -&nbsp;
man, you can't do anything.&nbsp;

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.480
But don't fall for that trick of Satan.
Because He who is in you is stronger than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.160
he who is in the world.
Remember&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.540
you have also received the Holy Spirit.
The Light of Christ.&nbsp;

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:38.520
That's why Jesus is called the Bright Morning&nbsp;
Star because He brought light into this world.&nbsp;

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:43.080
And He has already overcome this world.
I actually have this shirt on today - the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:48.360
lion of Judah - and that is exactly&nbsp;
who you have in your corner.&nbsp;

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:53.220
You're not alone in this.
Jesus is with you until the end of the age.&nbsp;

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.580
Remember that always.
I love you guys.&nbsp;

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.140
See you in the next video.
Bye.

